{
  "name": "Investor Research to Sheet / Notion / HTTP",
  "meta": {
    "templateId": "mentionfox-investor-research"
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Investor Research\n\n**What it does:** you type an investor's name into a form; it generates an **Investor Snapshot** - one page, founder-side: stage fit, trajectory, three strengths, three risk flags, and a one-line pitch / skip / pitch-with-prep - and appends it to your research sheet.\n\n**Use it while building a raise list.** Run every name through it before you spend a week chasing the wrong fund.\n\n**Setup**\n1. **Investor Name** - the built-in form, two fields.\n2. **Investor Snapshot** - needs the **MentionFox API credential** (`mf_pat_` key from mentionfox.com/connect).\n3. **Append to Research** - an HTTP Request node, so the template imports with no extra credential. Point it at Google Sheets, Notion or Airtable instead - the fields are already flattened in *Shape the Row*.\n\n**Cost:** one Investor Snapshot per name.",
        "height": 580,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky",
      "name": "Setup Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "Research an investor",
        "formDescription": "One name at a time. Add the firm if the name is common.",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Investor",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Firm"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "form",
      "name": "Investor Name",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ],
      "notes": "Entry point. Swap for a Google Sheets trigger to run a whole raise list."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "report",
        "operation": "investor_report",
        "report_investor_name": "={{ $json['Investor'] }}",
        "report_firm": "={{ $json['Firm'] }}"
      },
      "id": "snap",
      "name": "Investor Snapshot",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-mentionfox.mentionFox",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        480,
        300
      ],
      "notes": "MCP tool get_investor_report - one-page founder-side read on a VC or angel.",
      "credentials": {
        "mentionFoxApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_MENTIONFOX_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "MentionFox API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "n",
              "name": "investor",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $('Investor Name').item.json['Investor'] }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "f",
              "name": "firm",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $('Investor Name').item.json['Firm'] }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "r",
              "name": "recommendation",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.recommendation }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "u",
              "name": "public_url",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.public_url }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "d",
              "name": "researched_at",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $now.toISO() }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "row",
      "name": "Shape the Row",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        740,
        300
      ],
      "notes": "Flat fields, ready for whichever destination you use."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://example.com/webhook/investor-research",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "out",
      "name": "Append to Research",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1000,
        300
      ],
      "notes": "Replace with Google Sheets (Append Row), Notion (Create Database Page) or Airtable - the row is already shaped."
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Investor Name": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Investor Snapshot",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Investor Snapshot": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Shape the Row",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Shape the Row": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Append to Research",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "tags": [
    "mentionfox",
    "investor-research",
    "fundraising",
    "reports"
  ]
}
